 bins in our  courtyard yet everything's just thrown  in a big pile that's bad we want bins  too  valeria and varvara know that some trash  can be recycled even without the bins  barvara has a compost heap in her  family's garden up to 70 percent of the  garbage here in this rural district is  organic waste  soon this will turn into fertilizer for  flowers trees and for new vegetables  when we grow up we have to parcel this  on to our kids too  otherwise they'll just make a mess again  but i hope that people will listen up  now and start recycling because it's  really easy  the two girls hope that other children  will also think twice and join them in  trying to make the environment and the  planet a little bit less polluted  you
 

